### LoggerFilterOptions — no Application Insights rule capping Information logs
GET http://localhost:7071/api/diagnostics/log-filters

### Bound RetryOptions — "MaxRetries": null in appsettings.json actually binds to 0 on .NET 10
GET http://localhost:7071/api/diagnostics/retry-options
